[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0010","text":"好厉害……！\n用南极的冰做刨冰啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0020","text":"不会……很冷吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0030","text":"没问题的。按照“冬天吃冰淇淋最棒理论”，\n美味应该会战胜寒冷才对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0040","text":"麻美美呢？\n对南极刨冰有兴趣吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0050","text":"……嘛\n只要他们把冰带到这里来的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0060","text":"呵呵……\n凉凉的……感觉好舒服……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0070","text":"不懂啊—\n重点明明是在南极吃这件事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0080","text":"那—南极外景的伴手礼，就等你们带回来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0090","text":"啊，三峰要带回来吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0095","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0100","text":"你不是想去那边吃嘛？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500600_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
